<title>PHILIPPINES: San Miguel declares 20 centavos cash div.</title>
<headline>San Miguel declares 20 centavos cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food and drinks conglomerate San Miguel Corp said on Tuesday its board of directors had approved a 20 centavos per share cash dividend.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Philippine Stocks Exchange, San Miguel said the dividend will be payable on January 17, 1997. The dividend will cover stockholders on record as of December 20.</p>
<p>The company said its stock and transfer books will be closed from December 21 to 31.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
